CGMiner is a combined FPGA and ASIC miner written in C with Scrypt
algorithm support. This is a FreeBSD fork based on cgminer 4.8.0 with
Zeus, GridSeed, and Lketc Scrypt ASIC driver support.

Features:
- Scrypt algorithm mining (Litecoin and derivatives)
- Zeus/ZeusMiner/GAW Fury ASIC support
- GridSeed ASIC support
- Lketc ASIC support
- Stratum protocol support
- Remote API interface
